*> Test of 40-1 section 7 (The chest family; T1001): slot positions, the main inventory origin Y0 = 31 + 18 R, the hotbar, image heights and labels, quick-move ranges and the missing filter.)
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-MENU-40-1-7.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY BESTATE.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(8192).
 01 WS-EDIT                PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-EDIT2               PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-EDIT3               PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-EDIT4               PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-IDX                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CAPACITY            BINARY-LONG VALUE 4096.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-TYPE10              BINARY-LONG VALUE 10.
 01 WS-E1 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E4 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E5 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E6 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E7 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E8 PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E9 PIC -(9)9.
